        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                "word": "mentalité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6c03f117-18c1-471d-a1fc-a88c52aeb565",
                        "entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "mentalités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                        "entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "glosses": [
                            "État d’esprit ; habitudes de pensée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee855b07-09be-4953-b686-fa71c1b4ff55",
                                "sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                                "text": "Il narra, en une esquisse sommaire et avec les omissions et les inexactitudes naturelles à son genre de mentalité, la série de ses aventures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f9733cb-bcb1-4ec9-bd39-7051df6b655d",
                                "sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                                "text": "La Scolastique […] a accrédité une mentalité qui n’a pas prise sur le réel, qui tient pour légitimes certaines illusions structurales de notre esprit : notre tendance à réaliser nos concepts et à réifier toutes choses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e68be5f3-ce60-4332-8dd1-3727dabf7de0",
                                "sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                                "text": "Il ne faut pas être finaliste. Il n’est vraiment guère scientifique de se demander à quoi sert telle ou telle chose, et c’est la preuve d’une mentalité peu avancée de se demander, comme Voltaire, « à quoi sert la précession des équinoxes. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6fe6b66c-43e5-4bb0-b38a-a4b7b69fae17",
                                "sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                                "text": "Les années quatre-vingt ont consacré l’enfant-roi mais aussi travaillé en profondeur les mentalités vers toujours plus d’individualisme, cet état ambivalent de l’autonomie et de l’hypersolitude."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07913614-04f8-41bb-b5a0-200d86aecc2b",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "source_sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mentalität",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mentalität",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b83b7d5d-ced4-33e7-bc47-6ea9d2e4123a",
                                        "entry_id": "d0a253d4-a036-3296-86ad-8cf0fa6146f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Denkweise, geistige Disposition"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff903f78-5d0c-4987-a17d-4c599dc8c76a",
                                                "sense_id": "b83b7d5d-ced4-33e7-bc47-6ea9d2e4123a",
                                                "text": "Die Mentalität der Leute ist in verschiedenen Gegenden eines Landes oft unterschiedlich."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56f73078-39e6-466c-83cb-6c5fa9ad5dd5",
                                                "sense_id": "b83b7d5d-ced4-33e7-bc47-6ea9d2e4123a",
                                                "text": "„Der Ablauf des riskanten illegalen Tiefflugs der beiden amerikanischen Piloten, die Umstände der Videoaufzeichnung, eine verbreitete Mentalität in der US-Armee, die lebendige internationale Fliegertradition legen es nahe, von einem fehlgeschlagenen Versuch auszugehen, sich mit einem beweisbaren Mutakt, dem Unterfliegen einer Seilbahn, als unverwüstliche Draufgänger auszuweisen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27aead50-04eb-47b2-b29e-59b243333967",
                                                "sense_id": "b83b7d5d-ced4-33e7-bc47-6ea9d2e4123a",
                                                "text": "„Doch am wichtigsten: Die Mentalität der Deutschen wird sich durch die neue Erfahrung als ein Vielvölkerstaat wandeln.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cef581be-1a56-4670-8928-a1ebddc59f06",
                                                "sense_id": "b83b7d5d-ced4-33e7-bc47-6ea9d2e4123a",
                                                "text": "„Sie werden vielfach als langes, besser nicht zu vertiefendes Vorspiel zum Zivilisationsbruch wahrgenommen und nicht als Jahrhunderte, in denen sich unsere Mentalität herausbildete, unsere Kultur, auch viele unserer Werte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e4e0872-6168-4424-af3e-b052ec35803a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "source_sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                        "target_lang_word": "mentality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mentality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80f3e15f-c13f-376b-810e-a6064aa59bf1",
                                        "entry_id": "f66752cb-3d5c-3f3f-bb78-1930e629b238",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mindset; a way of thinking; a set of beliefs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12a9099b-ab0f-4cec-ba17-49488f26913b",
                                                "sense_id": "80f3e15f-c13f-376b-810e-a6064aa59bf1",
                                                "text": "Before he can succeed, he will have to shed the mentality that he can get by without hard work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fabec353-66c0-45e5-951e-e48388338af7",
                                                "sense_id": "80f3e15f-c13f-376b-810e-a6064aa59bf1",
                                                "text": "[…]with a mentality anchored in a profoundly influential and persistent hostility to central features of the Enlightment faith in the theoretical and practical autonomy of the human subject."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c73bc06-ebc2-3f44-8005-15cd123389c6",
                                        "entry_id": "f66752cb-3d5c-3f3f-bb78-1930e629b238",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristics of a mind described as a system of distinctive structures and processes based in biology, language, or culture, etc.; a mental system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3ec8da8-a45d-4c0c-a571-f48ca8d4bd77",
                                                "sense_id": "2c73bc06-ebc2-3f44-8005-15cd123389c6",
                                                "text": "1978, Edward Proffitt, \"Romanticism, Bicamerality, and the Evolution of the Brain\", The Wordsworth Circle, Vol. 9, No.1, reprinted in Kuijsten, 2016, page 129.\n[…] the new mentality [of Romantic poetry]...is a mentality of self-authorization."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94afdc71-18c0-42e7-ad38-d9d0a5c198b0",
                                                "sense_id": "2c73bc06-ebc2-3f44-8005-15cd123389c6",
                                                "text": "Our mentality — whether bicameral or conscious — is thus more a function of social context, language, and forms of communication than a hard-wired neurologically-based system."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8b6ce46a-a9f8-4696-92d3-7cfb8da51c37",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "source_sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
                        "target_lang_word": "mindset",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mindset",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee7a5b13-1151-382d-84f7-d68c43222c28",
                                        "entry_id": "5633164d-194f-3e94-9af3-f5da35deeab5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A way of thinking; an attitude or opinion, especially a habitual one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a288f562-d210-41ec-9d8d-b4c38329beb5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee7a5b13-1151-382d-84f7-d68c43222c28",
                                                "text": "Earth Day is a way of propagating and celebrating the environmentalist mindset."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72d96c38-388e-41d0-8593-b35dd42b8bfb",
                                                "sense_id": "ee7a5b13-1151-382d-84f7-d68c43222c28",
                                                "text": "You've got to use your weekend / Go nuts if you can / 'Cause you're back out until Monday, back out until Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday / It's the English mindset"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69543545-31ae-45ac-ae95-c6ad31f2d781",
                                                "sense_id": "ee7a5b13-1151-382d-84f7-d68c43222c28",
                                                "text": "These behaviors and mindsets contrast with mindful eating, which means using all your physical and emotional senses to experience and enjoy the food choices you make without judgment, said Lilian Cheung, a lecturer and director of health promotion and communication in the nutrition department at Harvard T.H. Chan School of Public Health, via email. […] Once you have been mindfully eating for a while, the mindset can apply to other areas of your life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b57f5da1-1450-470f-9717-a7ad5bc5a6ac",
                                                "sense_id": "ee7a5b13-1151-382d-84f7-d68c43222c28",
                                                "text": "Some 46% of those polled agreed that the office environment puts them in a better mindset for work, with this figure rising to 55% of 18-34-year-olds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "685c6a67-82e9-439f-a0cc-ec309046846e",
                        "source_entry_id": "1c15a946-9688-331c-bea9-bf8a44271241",
                        "source_sense_id": "f166c452-c22a-33f2-9143-70333e25d84f",
